{"name":"Ninja","hex":"#020308","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Ninja","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An anti-government Bakongo rebel, active in Pool Department, Republic of the Congo (Congo-Brazzaville)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Ninja"}],"entries":[{"title":"Ninja","blocks":[{"text":"A ninja , shinobi no mono  or shinobi  was a spy and infiltrator in pre-modern Japan. Antecedents may have existed as early as the 12th century. Despite popular belief, there is little evidence that ninja were assassins."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Hokusai-sketches---hokusai-manga-vol6-crop.jpg/330px-Hokusai-sketches---hokusai-manga-vol6-crop.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ninja","wikidata":"Q9402"},{"title":"Ninja (gamer)","blocks":[{"text":"Richard Tyler Blevins, known online as Ninja, is an American online streamer, YouTuber, and professional gamer. Blevins began streaming through participating in several esports teams in competitive play for Halo 3, and gradually picked up fame when he first started playing Fortnite Battle Royale in late 2017. Blevins gained the notice of mainstream media in March 2018 when he played Fortnite together with Drake, Travis Scott, and JuJu Smith-Schuster on stream, breaking a peak viewer count record on Twitch. Blevins had over 19 million followers on his Twitch channel, making it the 3rd most-followed Twitch channel as of July 2025."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/75/Krystalogy%2C_Jess%2C_Ninja%2C_and_Typical_Gamer_relaxing_in_the_State_Farm_Gamerhood_%2852899874282%29_%283x4_cropped_on_Ninja_and_rotated%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ninja_(gamer)","wikidata":"Q50825725"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/